<title>USA: Colorado MEDtech to buy back common stock.</title>
<headline>Colorado MEDtech to buy back common stock.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colorado MEDtech Inc said Monday it has decided to buy back up to $750,000 of its common stock.</p>
<p>The purchases will take place from time to time on the open market.</p>
<p>Colorado MEDtech develops, manufactures, markets and services computerized diagnostic and testing instrumentation, primarily in the respiratory market.</p>
